	</row>
	<row id="msg_0542_T20_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">-</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0542_T20_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0}! Where are you going?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0542_T20_00022" index="22">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Elm has been waiting for you.\fHe said he has something to give you.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0542_T20_00023" index="23">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Did you not hear me saying that\nProfessor Elm is waiting for you?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0542_T20_00024" index="24">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m getting upset!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0542_T20_00025" index="25">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The institute gets visitors from\nall over.\rEven a Kimono Girl from Ecruteak\ncame to see the professor once!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0542_T20_00026" index="26">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The institute gets visitors from\nall over.\rEven a Kimono Girl from Ecruteak\ncame to see the professor once!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0542_T20_00027" index="27">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lyra: Hi, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0542_T20_00028" index="28">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ethan: Hey, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0542_T20_00029" index="29">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Where do you think you’re going,\n{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0542_T20_00030" index="30">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Where do you think you’re going,\n{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0542_T20_00031" index="31">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lyra: Hmm... My Pokémon may be\nputting on some weight lately...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0542_T20_00032" index="32">
